---@field title? string The title that will show up in promotion campaign. Restricted to UTF-8 characters with max length of 100 bytes.
---@field description string The description of a promotion restricted to UTF-8 characters with max length 255.
---@field starts_at? string The date and time when the promotion is in effect in ISO 8601 format.
---@field ends_at? string The date and time when the promotion ends. Must be after starts_at and in ISO 8601 format.
---@field amount number The amount of the promo code discount. If 'type' is 'fixed', the amount is treated as a monetary value. If 'type' is 'percentage', amount must be a decimal value between 0.0 and 1.0, inclusive.
---@field type mailchimp.marketing.AddPromoRulesRequestType|string Type of discount. For free shipping set type to fixed.
---@field target mailchimp.marketing.AddPromoRulesRequestTarget|string The target that the discount applies to.
---@field enabled? boolean Whether the promo rule is currently enabled.
---@field created_at_foreign? string The date and time the promotion was created in ISO 8601 format.
---@field updated_at_foreign? string The date and time the promotion was updated in ISO 8601 format.

