---@field archive_url? string The link to the campaign's archive version.
---@field long_archive_url? string The original link to the campaign's archive version.
---@field status? mailchimp.marketing.CreateResendResponseStatus The current status of the campaign.
---@field emails_sent? number The total number of emails sent for this campaign.
---@field send_time? string The date and time a campaign was sent in ISO 8601 format.
