---@field unsubscribe_reason? string A subscriber's reason for unsubscribing.
---@field consents_to_one_to_one_messaging? boolean Indicates whether a contact consents to 1:1 messaging.
---@field sms_phone_number? string A US phone number for SMS contact.
---@field sms_subscription_status? mailchimp.marketing.GetListMemberResponseSmsSubscriptionStatus The status of an SMS subscription.
---@field sms_subscription_last_updated? string The datetime when the SMS subscription was last updated
---@field merge_fields? mailchimp.marketing.GetListMemberResponseMergeFieldsMap A dictionary of merge fields where the keys are the merge tags. See the [Merge Fields documentation](https://mailchimp.com/developer/marketing/docs/merge-fields/#structure) for more about the structure.
