---@field sort_dir? mailchimp.marketing.GetListMembersInfoRequestSortDir|string Determines the order direction for sorted results.
---@field since_last_campaign? boolean Filter subscribers by those subscribed/unsubscribed/pending/cleaned since last email campaign send. Member status is required to use this filter.
---@field unsubscribed_since? string Filter subscribers by those unsubscribed since a specific date. Using any status other than unsubscribed with this filter will result in an error.

