---@field name? string The name of the list.
---@field contact? mailchimp.marketing.GetListResponseContact [Contact information displayed in campaign footers](https://mailchimp.com/help/about-campaign-footers/) to comply with international spam laws.
---@field permission_reminder? string The [permission reminder](https://mailchimp.com/help/edit-the-permission-reminder/) for the list.
---@field use_archive_bar? boolean Whether campaigns for this list use the [Archive Bar](https://mailchimp.com/help/about-email-campaign-archives-and-pages/) in archives by default.
---@field campaign_defaults? mailchimp.marketing.GetListResponseCampaignDefaults [Default values for campaigns](https://mailchimp.com/help/edit-your-emails-subject-preview-text-from-name-or-from-email-address/) created for this list.
---@field notify_on_subscribe? string The email address to send [subscribe notifications](https://mailchimp.com/help/change-subscribe-and-unsubscribe-notifications/) to.
---@field notify_on_unsubscribe? string The email address to send [unsubscribe notifications](https://mailchimp.com/help/change-subscribe-and-unsubscribe-notifications/) to.
---@field date_created? string The date and time that this list was created in ISO 8601 format.
---@field list_rating? number An auto-generated activity score for the list (0-5).
---@field email_type_option? boolean Whether the list supports [multiple formats for emails](https://mailchimp.com/help/change-audience-name-defaults/). When set to `true`, subscribers can choose whether they want to receive HTML or plain-text emails. When set to `false`, subscribers will receive HTML emails, with a plain-text alternative backup.
---@field subscribe_url_short? string Our [url shortened](https://mailchimp.com/help/share-your-signup-form/) version of this list's subscribe form.
---@field subscribe_url_long? string The full version of this list's subscribe form (host will vary).
---@field beamer_address? string The list's [Email Beamer](https://mailchimp.com/help/use-email-beamer-to-create-a-campaign/) address.
---@field visibility? mailchimp.marketing.GetListResponseVisibility Legacy - visibility settings are no longer used
---@field double_optin? boolean Whether or not to require the subscriber to confirm subscription via email.
---@field has_welcome? boolean Whether or not this list has a welcome automation connected. Welcome Automations: welcomeSeries, singleWelcome, emailFollowup.
---@field marketing_permissions? boolean Whether or not the list has marketing permissions (eg. GDPR) enabled.
---@field modules? mailchimp.marketing.GetListResponseModulesList Any list-specific modules installed for this list.
---@field stats? mailchimp.marketing.GetListResponseStats Stats for the list. Many of these are cached for at least five minutes.
