---Report details about a sent campaign.
---@class mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItem
---@field id? string A string that uniquely identifies this campaign.
---@field campaign_title? string The title of the campaign.
---@field type? string The type of campaign (regular, plain-text, ab_split, rss, automation, variate, or auto).
---@field list_id? string The unique list id.
---@field list_is_active? boolean The status of the list used, namely if it's deleted or disabled.
---@field list_name? string The name of the list.
---@field subject_line? string The subject line for the campaign.
---@field preview_text? string The preview text for the campaign.
---@field emails_sent? number The total number of emails sent for this campaign.
---@field abuse_reports? number The number of abuse reports generated for this campaign.
---@field unsubscribed? number The total number of unsubscribed members for this campaign.
---@field send_time? string The date and time a campaign was sent in ISO 8601 format.
---@field rss_last_send? string For RSS campaigns, the date and time of the last send in ISO 8601 format.
---@field bounces? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemBounces An object describing the bounce summary for the campaign.
---@field forwards? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemForwards An object describing the forwards and forward activity for the campaign.
---@field opens? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemOpens An object describing the open activity for the campaign.
---@field clicks? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemClicks An object describing the click activity for the campaign.
---@field facebook_likes? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemFacebookLikes An object describing campaign engagement on Facebook.
---@field industry_stats? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemIndustryStats The average campaign statistics for your industry.
---@field list_stats? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemListStats The average campaign statistics for your list. This won't be present if we haven't calculated it yet for this list.
---@field ab_split? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemAbSplit General stats about different groups of an A/B Split campaign. Does not return information about Multivariate Campaigns.
---@field timewarp? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemTimewarpList An hourly breakdown of sends, opens, and clicks if a campaign is sent using timewarp.
---@field timeseries? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemTimeseriesList An hourly breakdown of the performance of the campaign over the first 24 hours.
---@field share_report? mailchimp.marketing.GetSubReportsForCampaignResponseReportsItemShareReport The url and password for the [VIP report](https://mailchimp.com/help/share-a-campaign-report/).
