---@class mailchimp.marketing.SearchCampaignsResponseResultsItemCampaignTrackingCapsule
---@field notes? boolean Update contact notes for a campaign based on subscriber email addresses.

---Deprecated
---@class mailchimp.marketing.SearchCampaignsResponseResultsItemCampaignTrackingSalesforce
