---@field subscribe? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a list subscriber is added.
---@field unsubscribe? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a list member unsubscribes.
---@field profile? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a contact's profile is updated. This includes email subscribers and SMS-only contacts [BETA].
---@field cleaned? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a subscriber's email address is cleaned from the list.
---@field upemail? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a subscriber's email address is changed.
---@field campaign? boolean Whether the webhook is triggered when a campaign is sent or cancelled.
---@field sms_subscribe? boolean [BETA] Whether the webhook is triggered when a contact subscribes to SMS.
---@field sms_unsubscribe? boolean [BETA] Whether the webhook is triggered when a contact unsubscribes from SMS.
---@field upsms? boolean [BETA] Whether the webhook is triggered when a contact's SMS phone number is updated.
---@field sms_campaign? boolean [BETA] Whether the webhook is triggered when an SMS campaign is sent.

---The possible sources of any events that can trigger the webhook and whether they are enabled.
